<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    FULL ORG MANIFEST
    Retrieves every retrievable metadata type from a sandbox/org.

    Usage (Salesforce CLI):
        sf project retrieve start -x manifest/package.xml -o <sandbox-alias>

    Notes:
    - Wildcard (*) on CustomObject returns CUSTOM objects only. Standard objects
      must be named explicitly (see the "Standard Objects" block below).
    - Folder-based types (Report, Dashboard, Document, EmailTemplate) return
      unfiled/public items with *. Folder contents also require the folder names,
      so the *Folder types are included and common folders can be added by name.
    - StandardValueSet does not support *; the common ones are listed explicitly.
    - For a smaller day-to-day manifest use manifest/package-core.xml.
-->
